OL,3,GNEWSAControversy to bring record crowd
OL,4,Ato village club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village football club is expecting to
OL,7,Fsee its attendance record broken
OL,8,Ftonight as a controversial FA Cup tie
OL,9,Fis replayed.
OL,11,FNorfolk side Mulbarton Wanderers beat
OL,12,FWoodford Town 2-1 in the second
OL,13,Fqualifying round but found themselves
OL,14,Fmaking national headlines after the
OL,15,FFootball Association (FA) ordered the
OL,16,Fmatch to be played again.
OL,18,FWoodford lodged a successful appeal
OL,19,Fwith the FA after a refereeing error
OL,20,Finvolving a first-half penalty.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
