OL,3,GNEWSAControversy to bring record crowd
OL,4,Ato village club
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Thompson, joint manager of
OL,7,FMulbarton, said the game would be an
OL,8,F"opportunity to show not only people
OL,9,Fhere, but nationally, internationally,
OL,10,Fhow good" their team is.
